    /// Fetches a circuit's live per-line stats and per-connector demand.
    ///
    /// The foundation for dynamic load balancing. Per-line current is the sum
    /// of every connector in the circuit's subtree's latest charger-meter
    /// reading; per-connector demand combines that reading with its active
    /// transaction's charging state; and, when the circuit has a linked Easee
    /// Equalizer, that device's own reading is reported alongside the
    /// charger-meter figure for the same line. Requires the caller to be at
    /// least a Member of the circuit's location's environment's organization.
