    /// The caller's own charging in a calendar month.
    ///
    /// One entry for every place the caller is linked to.
    /// A place is a project whose people use Flowion Home and where the caller's
    /// verified email is on an active principal. For each, what the caller's
    /// sessions came to including tax, the energy, their average price per kWh
    /// and the price of the month, and the sessions, newest first. A session
    /// still running is in the figures up to now.
    ///
    /// Another person's sessions, and the sessions nobody was tagged on, are
