    /// One person's month: what they charged and how it was priced, as totals.
    ///
    /// `principalId` is the person's id, or the word `untagged` for the sessions
    /// nobody was tagged on. The response has the same figures as the person's row
    /// on the month, and `priceRule` says how the price per quarter-hour was made,
    /// for the latest session priced from spot.
    ///
    /// The board gets totals per person and not when they charged, because a
    /// month of charging times shows when someone is home and when they are away:
    /// for a person `sessions` is always empty, and there is no quarter-hour grid.
    /// The times are on the person's own statement and in Flowion Home. The one
    /// exception is `untagged`: a session nobody is tagged on is no one's pattern,
    /// so `sessions` lists them, and the board finds each on its session record to
    /// tag it.
    ///
    /// A session still running is in the figures up to now. A person with no
    /// priced session in the month has no row, and is a `404`. Needs the
