    /// Clears a tariff assignment, notifying the affected station if applicable.
    ///
    /// Sets `supersededAt = now()` on the assignment, and issues
    /// `ClearTariffs` to affected stations if the level is
    /// `chargingStation`/`evse`.
    ///
    /// `projectId` in the path is what closes this route's formerly
    /// undocumented authorization gap: an assignment id alone is an opaque
    /// uuid no query could relate to a hierarchy node, so there was nothing to
    /// check before mutating. Now the caller names the environment, this
