    /// Lists a project's vehicles, paginated.
    ///
    /// Each `id` is the project's access id. A car another project also holds
    /// is a separate vehicle here, with its own id, name and status.
    ///
    /// Each vehicle also says who drives it (`assignees`) and where it is
    /// charging (`chargingAt`), in this response, so a page is one request: a
    /// charger of the project's own organization is named, one of another
